  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Codex Token 與費用估算的證據界線",
      "description": "保留 Codex 原生 token_type 作除錯，並以 accounting schema v2 顯示 exact model 的 API estimate；Auto-review 角色與 credits 請使用專用 dashboard。",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 原生訊號與 canonical accounting 分開閱讀\n\n原生 `codex_*` panels 保留 provider 的 `model` 與 `token_type`，適合核對 input、cached input、cache-write、output、reasoning 與 total。Canonical accounting 使用新資料 schema v2，將 `agent_role` 與 `model_id` 分離。Auto-review 的真實 model 未由 telemetry 提供時會成為 `approval_reviewer + unmapped`，因此不猜 API USD 或 Codex credits；請改看 **Codex Auto-review 用量** dashboard。Cached input 依 rate card 折價，**不是免費**。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "最後觀測累積計價 Token",
      "description": "最後觀測的 canonical cumulative accounting token；僅供總量核對。Auto-review 的 role/model 分流請看專用 dashboard。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(ai_agent_token_usage_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",accounting_schema=\"v2\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost|-role)?-fixture$\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Token"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "所選範圍預估費用（USD）",
      "description": "所選時間範圍內 exact model 可估價部分的公開 API USD estimate；不是帳單、訂閱或 Codex credits，unmapped 用量維持未估價。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(ai_agent_estimated_cost_usd_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",accounting_schema=\"v2\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost|-role)?-fixture$\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "Estimated cost",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "估價覆蓋率",
      "description": "所選模型在新資料 schema v2 中可對應 exact API rate 的 token 比例；unmapped reviewer usage 維持未估價。",
      "type": "gauge",
